From 5bc961b3bd841d70c62af10165585bde265f3f1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vince.ceccarelli@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:15:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0031 attribution sums to NET; quotable means five things, not
 one (5399 passed)

carry_backtest printed "QUOTABLE: True" on DAILY CLOSES with no impact term
(INVENTORY D5). The flag tracked provenance alone. Provenance is necessary
and not sufficient.

is_a_quotable_return is now the conjunction of five computed conditions,
each printed as a checkbox with its reason:

  same_venue_same_quote_spot          [x] Binance spot vs Binance perp
  settlement_clock_basis              [ ] daily closes, not 00/08/16 UTC
  impact_haircut_applied              [ ] taker fee only
  rule_is_what_the_engine_runs        [ ] CarryEngine always runs the GATED rule
  rule_scored_on_an_untouched_window  [ ] HOLDOUT_SCORED = False (module constant)

No run is quotable today, and the tool says why, condition by condition.

Attribution identity, printed and ENFORCED (ArithmeticError otherwise):

  funding + basis + fees + borrow + impact + other = NET   (costs negative)
  basis = spot-leg price term + perp-leg price term        (price cancels, shown)

Default run, unchanged numbers: funding +43,171.83, basis +240.03,
fees -5,870.40, borrow -24,558.01, impact 0 (NOT MODELLED), other 0,
NET +12,983.45, residual 1e-11. 17 of 18 trades closed; the open one is
reported as a mark, separately.

Also: simulate_series() core so synthetic series prove the hedge (random walk
with zero basis books 0.00 of price P&L; a stable +10 bps basis through a
doubling moves the book by at most basis x move); Bitstamp USD removed as a
spot source; the duplicated SPOT_SOURCES/drop_open_bar/resolve_spot/
_carry_costs definitions removed; stale "no Binance spot" docstring fixed.

TESTS CHANGED, and why each assertion is STRICTER, not weaker:
  test_quotability_is_earned_not_assumed, test_a_proxy_source_explains_itself,
  test_quotability_tracks_the_source_actually_used asserted
  `quotable == same_venue`. They now assert the provenance condition exactly
  as before AND that quotable is the conjunction of all five. Every run that
  was non-quotable before is still non-quotable; one that was quotable is not.
17 new tests.

PHASE1_DECISION.md: erratum APPENDED (the signed-for text is not edited).

